---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — KDS Airdrop Hub"
  description="Privacy Policy for KDS Airdrop Hub explaining website information, cookies, analytics, and user privacy."
  canonical="https://airdrop-hub.cryptoatlas.workers.dev/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="article">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="article-header">
          <span class="coming-soon-badge">Privacy</span>
          <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p class="article-meta">Last reviewed: September 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="article-body">
          <h2>Overview</h2>
          <p>
            KDS Airdrop Hub respects your privacy. This page explains the
            general approach to information and privacy on this website.
          </p>

          <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            KDS Airdrop Hub does not intentionally ask visitors to submit
            private wallet credentials, seed phrases, private keys, or
            passwords.
          </p>

          <p>
            If a future feature collects information such as an email
            address, the purpose and relevant handling of that information
            will be explained at the point of collection.
          </p>

          <h2>Newsletter</h2>
          <p>
            The newsletter area of the website is currently presented as a
            non-active feature. No newsletter signup information is
            intentionally collected through the current placeholder
            interface.
          </p>

          <h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
          <p>
            The website may use technologies provided by hosting, analytics,
            security, or other third-party services where applicable. Such
            services may process technical information according to their own
            privacy policies.
          </p>

          <h2>Third-Party Websites</h2>
          <p>
            Some educational content may refer to external websites or
            blockchain projects. Once you leave KDS Airdrop Hub, the privacy
            practices of those external services are governed by their own
            policies.
          </p>

          <h2>Security</h2>
          <p>
            Reasonable measures are used to maintain the website, but no
            internet service can guarantee absolute security.
          </p>

          <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy may be updated when the website's features or
            data practices change. The latest review date is shown at the top
            of this page.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
